 | `llvm_clang.py` | LLVM 22.1.8's release clang (zig 0.17.1's LLVM) for `setup/clang`: the official archive read once and checked by sha256, only the binary kept in `build/dist/dl/llvm-<version>-<target>/` (Linux stripped, 236 MB; Windows from the NSIS installer with 7-Zip, 105 MB). It compiles the game code's chunks ~30 % faster than zig's LLVM (`tools/prepare/fastcc.py`) | imported by `dist.py`; by hand `uv run tools/build/llvm_clang.py linux\|windows` (1.9 / 0.46 GB download) |
